{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>聯合醫院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>上秀茂坪巴士總站發生交通意外。 今日（21日）早上8時48分，一名年約40多歲女子於秀茂坪曉光街近上秀茂坪巴士總站對開過路時，遭一輛俗稱「小露寶」的混能的士撞倒，應聲倒地受傷。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，發現女子清醒，由救護車將她送往聯合醫院治理。警方正在調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:20:07.538324+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:46:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T12:38:22.918475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:17:40.569058+00:00","content_hash":"2d0cada5176e4336e0202ad9ee53eff26d4887ac21588b0d4ab1104c168adb79","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}